<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-RAS raised at Lehman.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-RAS raised at Lehman.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian insurace group RAS was raised to &quot;neutral&quot; from &quot;underperform&quot; at Lehman Brothers on Tuesday, the investment bank said.</p>
<p>Lehman said the stock had outperformed through the past 18 months and added it expected more robust proft growth in the next two years from the company.</p>
<p>However &quot;several negative influences&quot; continued to taint investors' views on the stock, Lehman said.</p>
<p>Further detail was not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
</text>
